# Diagrams Directory

This directory stores visual diagrams for VitalForge documentation.

## Planned Diagrams

- `erd.png` / `erd.svg` - Entity Relationship Diagram (database schema)
- `architecture.png` - System architecture overview
- `user-flows.png` - User interaction flows
- `deployment.png` - Deployment architecture

## Generating ERD

Use rails-erd gem:
```bash
gem 'rails-erd', group: :development
bundle exec erd --filename=docs/diagrams/erd
```

Or create manually using:
- dbdiagram.io
- draw.io
- lucidchart

See [/docs/README.md](../README.md) for detailed instructions.

